  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile setups with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (e.g., config_010) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests whether using pca_n2000 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (vs. scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l in config_010) impacts performance, isolating the effect of encoder choices. It balances exploitation of multiprofile/transformer/weighted patterns with exploration of encoder alternatives, avoiding unnecessary changes to other components."
